{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wolf pack is hungry. Help them catch all the sheep on each level! But watch out: the world is dangerous, and you can't lose any wolves along the way. Fortunately, you will have various tools to guide your wolves to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add or destroy parts of each level to reach new areas. Every pixel matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931270/extras/1c3f270e7767990b5f438e35f874ed3d.avif?t=1755346508\" data-has-big width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water flows wherever it can go. Use this to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931270/extras/340147ab7b386509bae8a2fd11d90fe5.poster.avif?t=1755346508\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931270/extras/340147ab7b386509bae8a2fd11d90fe5.webm?t=1755346508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931270/extras/340147ab7b386509bae8a2fd11d90fe5.mp4?t=1755346508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many Tools to Use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bridges, bombs, rockets, and more to control your wolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931270/extras/b2c394fd59b265f63ee34ac018ffe6cf.avif?t=1755346508\" width=647 height=98 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931270?t=1755346508","background_raw":"https://st